   ],
   "by": "research-r058",
   "run": "provenance-research-2026-10-23",
   "note": "Open spaces are the classic answer (Westphal 1871, DSM-5 domain) but agoraphobia is broader: situations where escape or help is hard; the article notes already accept public places and crowds."
  },
